tools.description:
List existing custom apps or get metadata for a specific app with optional sections and/or docs.

Available sections: base, groups, install, installSpec

Sections are returned as JSONC strings (JSON with comments), except for 'groups' which is plain JSON. Comments contain useful context — preserve them when updating.

<usage>
- List all apps: { }
- Get metadata for a specific app: { appName, appVersion }
- Get app metadata with sections: { appName, appVersion, sections: ["base", "groups"] }
- Get app metadata with docs: { appName, appVersion, includeDocs: true }
- Get app metadata with sections and docs: { appName, appVersion, sections: ["base"], includeDocs: true }
</usage>

List all connections for an app or get metadata for a specific connection with optional sections.

Available sections: api, parameters, scopes, scope

Sections are returned as JSONC strings (JSON with comments). Comments contain useful context — preserve them when updating.

<usage>
- List all connections for an app: { appName }
- Get metadata for a specific connection: { connectionName }
- Get connection metadata with sections: { connectionName, sections: ["api", "parameters"] }
</usage>

List all modules for an app or get metadata for a specific module with optional sections.

